@page "/"

<PageTitle>Official Cloud Icons</PageTitle>

<div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">
    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem 1rem;">
        <h1 style="font-size: 2.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">👋 Welcome to Cloud Icons!</h1>
        <p style="font-size: 1.1rem; color: #6b7280; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
            The ultimate source for official cloud service icons
        </p>
    </div>

    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #f0f1ff 0%, #f5f3ff 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid #6366f1;">
        <h2 style="color: #6366f1; margin-top: 0;">✨ Why CloudIcons?</h2>
        <ul style="line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            <li><strong>Official Icons</strong> - Direct from Microsoft, AWS, and Google Cloud</li>
            <li><strong>Always Updated</strong> - Nightly updates check for new icons automatically 🌙</li>
            <li><strong>Multiple Formats</strong> - Download as SVG or PNG</li>
            <li><strong>Easy to Use</strong> - Search, filter, and copy to clipboard</li>
            <li><strong>Comprehensive</strong> - 8,000+ icons from multiple cloud providers</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 3px solid #667eea;">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea;">🎨 Azure</h3>
            <p style="color: #6b7280;">661 official icons</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9ca3af;">Last Updated: January 2025</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 3px solid #764ba2;">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #764ba2;">☁️ AWS</h3>
            <p style="color: #6b7280;">3,712 official icons</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9ca3af;">Last Updated: July 31, 2025</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border-top: 3px solid #667eea;">
            <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #667eea;">🌐 Google Cloud</h3>
            <p style="color: #6b7280;">216+ official icons</p>
            <p style="font-size: 0.85rem; color: #9ca3af;">Always up-to-date</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 2rem; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); margin-bottom: 2rem;">
        <h2 style="margin-top: 0;">📚 All Available Icon Packs</h2>
        <ul style="line-height: 2; color: #374151;">
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/azure" style="color: #667eea;">Azure Architecture Icons</a></strong> - v18 (Jan 2025)</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/aws" style="color: #667eea;">AWS Architecture Icons</a></strong> - Updated Jul 31, 2025</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/gcp" style="color: #667eea;">Google Cloud Icons</a></strong></li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/fabric" style="color: #667eea;">Microsoft Fabric Icons</a></strong> - Updated Aug 21, 2025</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/microsoft365" style="color: #667eea;">Microsoft 365 Icons</a></strong> - Jan 9, 2024</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/powerplatform" style="color: #667eea;">Power Platform Icons</a></strong> - Dec 19, 2025</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/dynamics365" style="color: #667eea;">Dynamics 365 Icons</a></strong> - Dec 19, 2025</li>
            <li>✓ <strong><a href="/iconlist/entra" style="color: #667eea;">Entra (Azure AD) Icons</a></strong></li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #fef3c7 0%, #fde68a 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #92400e;">ℹ️ How to Use</h3>
        <ol style="line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            <li>Select an icon provider from the menu</li>
            <li>Use the search box to find icons by name or category</li>
            <li><strong>Right-click</strong> on an icon to copy it to clipboard</li>
            <li>Or click <strong>Download</strong> to save as SVG or PNG</li>
            <li>Paste directly into your designs, presentations, or diagrams</li>
        </ol>
    </div>

    <div style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #dbeafe 0%, #e0e7ff 100%); border-radius: 12px; padding: 1.5rem; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;">
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0; color: #1e40af;">🛠️ Disclaimer</h3>
        <p style="color: #1e3a8a; margin: 0;">
            I don't own these icons - they belong to their respective cloud providers. This application simply redistributes them for your convenience 
            in a user-friendly interface. All icons are sourced from official cloud provider repositories.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div style="text-align: center; padding: 2rem 0; color: #6b7280;">
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;">
            Made with ❤️ by <a href="https://michaeljohnpena.com" style="color: #667eea;">Michael John Peña</a> • 
            <a href="https://github.com/mjtpena/CloudIcons" style="color: #667eea;">GitHub</a>
        </p>
    </div>
</div>
